      "statement":"Each classification consumes but remains separate from assessment and takes exactly one core value for its stated acceptance predicate at the cited sprint boundary. Accepted means compliant; local_paydown is falsified by ticketed local debt while the governing relation remains coherent; authority changes instead require repricing/invalid_basis. Design repricing changes accepted design, requirement repricing changes a governing requirement, and product repricing changes product definition. Removal is falsified by its removal reason without requiring a violated relation or competing truth path and has no matching disposition. Repricing layer names are domain facts, not additional results. Debt outcomes map on the analogous debt-acceptance predicate. These mappings add neither dispositions nor core values; closed requires outcomes for all entries, not satisfied outcomes. Remaining debt, needed repricing and removal must never be read as compliance.",
